  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 16.8,
      "e": 19.02,
      "text": "The rest of the world probably will not"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.02,
      "e": 21.13,
      "text": "know about our role , um , but that's"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.13,
      "e": 23.52,
      "text": "OK . I'm Major Chris Kaufman . I'm the"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.52,
      "e": 26.24,
      "text": "assistant air attache , uh , stationed"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.24,
      "e": 28.86,
      "text": "in Bangkok . To the kingdom of Thailand ."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.99,
      "e": 34.24,
      "text": "On June 23rd , the children were"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.24,
      "e": 35.3,
      "text": "reported missing ."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.84,
      "e": 41.9,
      "text": "The Thai government coordinated with"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.9,
      "e": 44.12,
      "text": "the US government and orders started to"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.12,
      "e": 46.96,
      "text": "come down on the 26th . We used a"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.96,
      "e": 48.85,
      "text": "unique capability that we have in"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.85,
      "e": 51.4,
      "text": "Bangkok , and uh it's a uh a C-12"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.4,
      "e": 53.62,
      "text": "that's stationed there . So the C-12 is"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.62,
      "e": 55.8,
      "text": "a small twin-engine King Air and"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.8,
      "e": 58.0,
      "text": "usually capable of handling about 6"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.0,
      "e": 60.32,
      "text": "passengers . We had to remove all the"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.32,
      "e": 62.15,
      "text": "seats to get the MREs in there ."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.68,
      "e": 66.42,
      "text": "They're these vacuum packed meals that"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.42,
      "e": 69.68,
      "text": "provide a lot of calories and sustain a"
    },
    {
      "s": 69.68,
      "e": 73.4,
      "text": "combat operation or sustain warfighters"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.4,
      "e": 77.16,
      "text": "for you know a day or two with just one"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.16,
      "e": 80.76,
      "text": "meal . We delivered about"
    },
    {
      "s": 80.76,
      "e": 83.72,
      "text": "500 pounds worth of MREs , these meals"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.72,
      "e": 85.78,
      "text": "ready to eat , and the reason why we"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.78,
      "e": 87.94,
      "text": "brought these MREs , uh , the children"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.94,
      "e": 90.0,
      "text": "were discovered on the 2nd of July ."
    },
    {
      "s": 105.74,
      "e": 107.85,
      "text": "The children were found . That in and"
    },
    {
      "s": 107.85,
      "e": 110.02,
      "text": "of itself was a miracle , and the fact"
    },
    {
      "s": 110.02,
      "e": 112.07,
      "text": "that they were alive was a miracle ."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.43,
      "e": 114.87,
      "text": "The news of the century is going on in"
    },
    {
      "s": 114.87,
      "e": 117.75,
      "text": "Chiang Rai , and we're working with uh"
    },
    {
      "s": 117.75,
      "e": 120.23,
      "text": "our ground handlers , and they asked us"
    },
    {
      "s": 120.23,
      "e": 122.47,
      "text": "where we were going and we said well"
    },
    {
      "s": 122.47,
      "e": 124.53,
      "text": "we're we're flying to Chiang Rai and"
    },
    {
      "s": 124.53,
      "e": 126.58,
      "text": "you could just see as we said Chiang"
    },
    {
      "s": 126.58,
      "e": 129.15,
      "text": "Rai they they got big grins ear to ear"
    },
    {
      "s": 129.15,
      "e": 132.88,
      "text": "and said oh Chiang Rai and they knew"
    },
    {
      "s": 133.43,
      "e": 135.43,
      "text": "they , they , they had an important"
    },
    {
      "s": 135.43,
      "e": 137.91,
      "text": "role to play . This was a Thai led"
    },
    {
      "s": 137.91,
      "e": 141.49,
      "text": "effort and you know all . All honors"
    },
    {
      "s": 141.49,
      "e": 143.97,
      "text": "should be bestowed on them there , but"
    },
    {
      "s": 143.97,
      "e": 146.41,
      "text": "we were happy to support in any way we"
    },
    {
      "s": 146.41,
      "e": 149.41,
      "text": "could . The real experts here were the"
    },
    {
      "s": 149.41,
      "e": 152.61,
      "text": "volunteers from the UK and other"
    },
    {
      "s": 152.61,
      "e": 155.57,
      "text": "nations , uh , generally in Europe who"
    },
    {
      "s": 155.57,
      "e": 157.85,
      "text": "were cave divers . At times you could"
    },
    {
      "s": 157.85,
      "e": 160.13,
      "text": "walk , at other times you had to crawl ,"
    },
    {
      "s": 160.13,
      "e": 162.46,
      "text": "and at any given point we're , you know ,"
    },
    {
      "s": 162.46,
      "e": 164.41,
      "text": "we're in the rainy season . At any"
    },
    {
      "s": 164.41,
      "e": 166.63,
      "text": "given point those caves could fill with"
    },
    {
      "s": 166.63,
      "e": 168.41,
      "text": "water , so it was an incredibly"
    },
    {
      "s": 168.41,
      "e": 169.63,
      "text": "dangerous operation ."
    },
    {
      "s": 179.87,
      "e": 182.79,
      "text": "DIA , uh , we played a support role"
    },
    {
      "s": 182.79,
      "e": 185.68,
      "text": "here and I'm proud of that . This"
    },
    {
      "s": 185.68,
      "e": 187.74,
      "text": "wasn't gonna make it into the movies"
    },
    {
      "s": 187.74,
      "e": 189.96,
      "text": "because that's not our role by bringing"
    },
    {
      "s": 189.96,
      "e": 192.18,
      "text": "these MREs up and they were able to get"
    },
    {
      "s": 192.18,
      "e": 195.06,
      "text": "to uh to the children and and also the"
    },
    {
      "s": 195.07,
      "e": 197.67,
      "text": "the divers they could use them . We're"
    },
    {
      "s": 197.67,
      "e": 199.89,
      "text": "here to support , support our country ,"
    },
    {
      "s": 199.92,
      "e": 202.14,
      "text": "support , uh , our nation , and support"
    },
    {
      "s": 202.14,
      "e": 204.36,
      "text": "the war fighter whether it's in Bangkok"
    },
    {
      "s": 204.36,
      "e": 207.35,
      "text": "or , uh , in Europe , South America ."
    },
    {
      "s": 207.48,
      "e": 208.52,
      "text": "That's what we're here for ."
    }
